  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/7c84fc7d79467528a44df28e2b62c0ceb71ea6ebbda317a47795f3e42d450c82.png] \n\nGiven equation: 3.2 Z (0.56 Y 1.4 X 4) W 5 X 5 Y 25 Z 5.\n\n \n \n\n \n \nLetter\n\n \n \n \nZ\n\n \n \n \nX\n\n \n \n \nY\n\n \n \n \nW\n\n \n \n \n\n \n \nMeaning\n\n \n \n \n+\n\n \n \n \n×\n\n \n \n \n÷\n\n \n \n \n-\n\n \n \n \n\nAfter replacing the letters by their meaning, we get:\n\n= 3.2 + (__**0.56 ÷ 1.4**__ × 4) - 5 × 5 ÷ 25 + 5\n\n= 3.2 + (__**0.4**____** ×**____** 4**__) - 5 × 5 ÷ 25 + 5\n\n= 3.2 + 1.6 - 5 × __**5 ÷ 25**__ + 5\n\n= 3.2 + 1.6 - __**5 **____**× 0.2**__ + 5\n\n= __**3.2 + 1.6**__ - 1 __**+ 5**__\n\n= __**9.8 - 1**__\n\n= 8.8\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option 2\".",
